"Build a fully functional e-commerce website. The homepage displays a product catalog (image, name, price) with search and category filters. Clicking a product opens its detail page. After sign-up/login, users can add items to cart, adjust quantities, and checkout to place an order - or buy directly from the detail page.\nA \"My Orders\" page lists all orders with full details (items, amount, shipping info, status). Data must be persisted with pre-loaded products. Teams define their own order state logic (e.g., how cancellation affects inventory) and keep frontend and backend in sync. The full flow - Browse → Login → Add to Cart → Checkout →\nView Order — must be demo-ready.\nStretch Goals\nLLM Shopping Assistant: Convert natural language queries like \"camping gear under ·300\" into product filters — only recommend items that actually exist in the catalog.\nConcurrency-Safe Inventory: Prevent overselling when multiple users order the same item simultaneously."
